        "notes": "Eighteen historical geologic units digitized from Voyager-era mapping. Registration reconstructed from the published map grid; three independent crater checks differ by about 1.3–3.3° (5–14 km). Colors identify interpreted units, not measured composition. Gray grid marks unmapped or unresolved overlapping units; structural linework is not shown.",
